</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-624-5"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">These interactive meetings bring together institutions to discuss the latest trends, hot topics, raise questions and share their own best practices. Please note these will be held quarterly (instead of monthly). Please click on the relevant date to register.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>AML Community Meetings</strong> (previously AML Special Interest Group)</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join Flywire for an interactive and engaging sessions focusing on Fraud and AML in Higher Education. The aim of these community meetings is for you to share your experiences and best practice with other community members. Part of these meetings will have a presentation from either Flywire, or an external speaker on an issue that will interest the audience.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/BC23536192?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;mkt_tok=MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGW8hekeqgMj1VYexNHqJ6-bB_Gk97JCOXTvm2PpqiQFNUkvPZ0wBcArxjDzCRvN_dOLkBQ0uNZZ7iVDIl13LM&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>21st January</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0pd-qqqjwpH9yVZKSNku1ot8LS2EpW8zXu?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>29th April</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0kcOGpqDosE9UXl0wBLVuJhFW2R1Q4L9ja?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>8th July</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJIsd-iqpj8pGtHoiyfZfX9CtV-6yKNv_E0n?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>14th October</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>International Payments Community Meetings</strong> <br />(previously Nigeria Coffee Chat)</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join Flywire for informative sessions led by Giles Rowlinson, Senior Payments Manager, EMEA who will provide insights on economic conditions, recent challenges and also recent improvements in payment options.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEucu6srjMoGdQzIAV3A1GikdruICFOJYux?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>6th February</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJckc--rrDgtHN2L_9Ps7DyyprOcJjIR-XlF?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>3rd April</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMpdO2gqDorGdRyD-0oiEzIbzokcDhwKfJG?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>3rd July</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYkceCtpjkiGN382k2R0qUP9fRLuPa8pGkr?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>2nd October</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>Tribal Community Meetings</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">NEW for 2025: Join Flywire's Tribal Community Meetings hosted by Oliver Mussett, Flywire's Senior Strategic Partner Manager who oversees Flywire's partnership with Tribal, and has recently joined Flywire following eight years working for Tribal.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYrdOivqz4vHdVEfhk_8QhHkJEoqlT9Geuc?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>13th February</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJwpfu2qpjMuHNXTNDPIxKE1d2W9fHFOdzlD?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>15th May</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUvf-igqTIsEtcvhZmprPMO3Q3-gIV_ROZE?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>10th July</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJcpd-2trzwrHtUdCZsYBO_ScUYfxbx5w05o?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>6th November</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>Payment Security Community Meetings</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join the Flywire Payment Security Community meetings hosted by Dave Neild, Lead Security Consultant to hear the latest insights from the Payment Security team. Each meeting will focus on a hot topic. The first meeting in March will examine opportunities to simplify your Payment Security program by outsourcing to compliant Third Party Service Providers acting as a Merchant of Record, with a focus on payment channels for both e-commerce and physical devices.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqcu2rpjgvH9BYLSa4NmVqJDS2sHG0Wo_m?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>26th March</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYlcO-opjguG9zFUwRDv8uGDhldewpaaPG5?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>22nd October</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJEvduyvrTMqGdxMIm16rH1Lxkb43Iw4Ty2u?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>9th December</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Monthly QSA drop in calls</strong><br />In addition, we will host monthly QSA drop in calls, every third Wednesday of the month, from 12:30 - 13:30. You can register for individual calls below or you can <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/nv24180453?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>add the full series</u></strong></span></a> to your calendar.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/Lg24086790?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>15th January</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/gs24099891?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>19th February</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/TN24180400?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>19th March</u></strong></span></a> | <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/Ci24099915?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>16th April</u></strong></span></a></p> </td> 
</tr> 
