<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>17th - 18th June 2025</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Hilton Deansgate Hotel, Manchester</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Join us for the leading payment security and compliance event for the higher education sector. In its 14th year, this will be a jam-packed event full of insights from industry experts and peers in the education sector. Focusing on payment security and building on previous events we will look at the latest insights from the PCI Security Standards Council, learn from institutions implementing payment security programmes and identify best practices.</p> </td> 
